- `_handle_get_sales_order_by_id` reads ids from phrases like `get sales order so-123` and `sales order with id so-123`.

`_infer_tool` returns the tool name and the raw id (`emp-001`, `emp001`, `so-123`, `ord-001`). Uppercasing still happens in `mcp_client` before the FastMCP call. List questions and greetings are unchanged and still follow the model.

